@base = https://localhost:7042
@token = paste-admin-jwt-here

### Danh mục permission
GET {{base}}/api/admin/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Danh sách role
GET {{base}}/api/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tạo role tùy chỉnh
POST {{base}}/api/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lễ tân",
  "description": "Tiếp nhận và xử lý đặt phòng"
}

### Gán permission cho role
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/roles/4/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissionCodes": ["bookings.view", "bookings.manage", "payments.view"]
}

### Gán role cho user
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/users/2/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleIds": [2, 4]
}
